-- statement:
--   Under the actual C=top admissible strategy, any finite real spatial strip lies in the genuine positive reserve HJB domain, so the physical stopped generator residual has L1 and nonpositive expectation on the original predictable clock. This is the upper-barrier finite-strip stage for top-cap exhaustion.
